# .clang-tidy configuration for symdep
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-*,
  -bugprone-reserved-identifier,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling,
  -readability-identifier-length

WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: 'src/.*|include/.*'
FormatStyle: file
